  "custom_logic_notes": "BuyOne/SellOne boolean flags act as a one-trade-per-direction latch: after a buy, BuyOne=false prevents further buys until a sell resets it (BuyOne=true, SellOne=false). This means the EA alternates between buy and sell — it cannot take two consecutive buys. SL/TP are adjusted by 10x for 5/3 digit brokers. Minimum 60 bars required at initialization and on each tick. All indicator values are read from bar index 1 (previous completed bar), not bar 0 (current forming bar).",
